{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Yapori Show Maker is a story creation editor based on the animated series The Yapori Show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5 characters, each with different poses to use in this creation editor, such as Yapori, a green fox with a blue scarf; Darkpori, a black fox with a gray scarf; Chuck, a blue chicken; Jack, a yellow monkey; and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Texts to make the characters interact with each other, whether talking, fighting, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some different backgrounds to use in the creation editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brief tutorial to learn how to use the application.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852290?t=1752345901","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852290?t=1752345901","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852290/d5a0330863e22c8202cf0e79615f0cb29d862d06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752345901","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852290/d5a0330863e22c8202cf0e79615f0cb29d862d06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752345901","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Yapori Show Maker is a story creation editor based on the animated series The Yapori Show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5 characters, each with different poses to use in this creation editor, such as Yapori, a green fox with a blue scarf; Darkpori, a black fox with a gray scarf; Chuck, a blue chicken; Jack, a yellow monkey; and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Texts to make the characters interact with each other, whether talking, fighting, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_par